<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
    <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
    <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="black-translucent">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#0f0c29">
    <link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.json">
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/icons/icon-192.svg">
    <title>Jogos de Festa</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; }

        :root {
            --bg-dark: #0a0a1a;
            --bg-card: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
            --border: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
            --text: #ffffff;
            --text-dim: #8888aa;
            --purple: #8b5cf6;
            --red: #ef4444;
            --gold: #f59e0b;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;
            background: var(--bg-dark);
            color: var(--text);
            min-height: 100dvh;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        /* Animated gradient background */
        .bg-glow {
            position: fixed;
            top: -50%; left: -50%;
            width: 200%; height: 200%;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 40%, rgba(139,92,246,0.15) 0%, transparent 50%),
                        radial-gradient(circle at 70% 60%, rgba(239,68,68,0.1) 0%, transparent 50%);
            animation: bgFloat 20s ease-in-out infinite;
            z-index: 0;
            pointer-events: none;
        }
        @keyframes bgFloat {
            0%, 100% { transform: translate(0, 0); }
            33% { transform: translate(30px, -30px); }
            66% { transform: translate(-20px, 20px); }
        }

        .container {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            max-width: 420px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 60px 20px 40px;
            min-height: 100dvh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 48px;
        }

        .header .icon {
            font-size: 64px;
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            animation: bounce 2s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
        @keyframes bounce {
            0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
            50% { transform: translateY(-10px); }
        }

        .header h1 {
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f9d423, #ff4e50, #8b5cf6);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-size: 200% 200%;
            animation: gradientShift 4s ease infinite;
        }
        @keyframes gradientShift {
            0%, 100% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
            50% { background-position: 100% 50%; }
        }

        .header p {
            color: var(--text-dim);
            font-size: 15px;
            margin-top: 8px;
        }

        .games {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 16px;
            flex: 1;
        }

        .game-card {
            display: block;
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 24px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--text);
            transition: transform 0.15s, background 0.15s;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .game-card:active {
            transform: scale(0.97);
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
        }

        .game-card .glow {
            position: absolute;
            top: -1px; left: -1px; right: -1px;
            height: 3px;
            border-radius: 20px 20px 0 0;
        }
        .card-justone .glow { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #667eea, #764ba2, #8b5cf6); }
        .card-impostor .glow { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ef4444, #f97316, #ef4444); }

        .game-card .card-top {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .game-card .card-icon {
            width: 56px;
            height: 56px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 28px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .card-justone .card-icon { background: rgba(139,92,246,0.2); }
        .card-impostor .card-icon { background: rgba(239,68,68,0.2); }

        .game-card h2 {
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        .game-card .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 3px 10px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .card-justone .badge { background: rgba(139,92,246,0.2); color: #a78bfa; }
        .card-impostor .badge { background: rgba(239,68,68,0.2); color: #fca5a5; }

        .game-card p {
            color: var(--text-dim);
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .game-card .arrow {
            position: absolute;
            right: 20px;
            top: 50%;
            transform: translateY(-50%);
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
            font-size: 20px;
        }

        .footer {
            margin-top: auto;
            padding-top: 40px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .footer .install-hint {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 16px;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: var(--text-dim);
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        .footer .install-hint strong { color: var(--text); }

        .footer .version {
            margin-top: 16px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="bg-glow"></div>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <span class="icon">🎮</span>
            <h1>Jogos de Festa</h1>
            <p>Escolhe um jogo e diverte-te!</p>
        </div>

        <div class="games">
            <a href="/justone.html" class="game-card card-justone">
                <div class="glow"></div>
                <div class="card-top">
                    <div class="card-icon">💡</div>
                    <div>
                        <h2>Just One</h2>
                        <span class="badge">3–7 jogadores</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <p>Dá pistas de uma só palavra para ajudar o adivinhador a descobrir a palavra secreta. Cuidado com as pistas repetidas — são eliminadas!</p>
                <span class="arrow">›</span>
            </a>

            <a href="/impostor.html" class="game-card card-impostor">
                <div class="glow"></div>
                <div class="card-top">
                    <div class="card-icon">🕵️</div>
                    <div>
                        <h2>Impostor</h2>
                        <span class="badge">3–10 jogadores</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <p>Todos recebem uma palavra secreta... menos o impostor! Descobre quem está a fingir antes que seja tarde demais.</p>
                <span class="arrow">›</span>
            </a>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <div class="install-hint">
                📱 <strong>Instalar como app:</strong><br>
                Safari → Partilhar → <em>Adicionar ao ecrã inicial</em><br>
                Chrome → Menu → <em>Adicionar ao ecrã inicial</em>
            </div>
            <div class="version">Jogos de Festa v1.0</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        if ('serviceWorker' in navigator) {
            navigator.serviceWorker.register('/sw.js');
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
